      en: ["The waterfalls are situated on the upper course of the Bregalnica River", "There are a total of seven main waterfalls in this area", "The most famous one is the Spikovski Waterfall", "Located at an elevation exceeding 1,200 meters above sea level", "The region is part of the Maleshevo mountain massif", "The rock composition primarily consists of granite and schist"],
